{"n":13,"title":"5 a.m. club vs. night owls","blurb":"Рассказывать о своём распорядке дня","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"note","title":"5 a.m. club vs. night owls","sub":"","html":"<p>Настоящие режимы дня: мама девятерых и человек, который завтракает в 14:00.</p><ul class=\"cp-aims\"><li>Рассказывать о своём дне</li><li>Использовать I get up / she gets up</li><li>Говорить, когда вы что-то делаете</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Что вы делаете до 9 утра?","sub":"Здесь нет неправильного ответа.","options":[{"label":"get up"},{"label":"have breakfast"},{"label":"check emails"},{"label":"go to work"},{"label":"have a shower"},{"label":"sleep"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"get up","pos":"","ru":"вставать","kk":"тұру","def":"I get up at six.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/f26ba120b929.mp3"},{"en":"have a shower","pos":"","ru":"принимать душ","kk":"душ қабылдау","def":"Then I have a shower.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/8941b65c281c.mp3"},{"en":"get dressed","pos":"","ru":"одеваться","kk":"киіну","def":"I get dressed at 7.15.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/4c01b5e2759e.mp3"},{"en":"check emails","pos":"","ru":"проверять почту","kk":"поштаны тексеру","def":"I check emails at 5 a.m.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/bd08a5e74a82.mp3"},{"en":"have breakfast","pos":"","ru":"завтракать","kk":"таңғы ас ішу","def":"We have breakfast together.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/bcb10d41d9b2.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите действие.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/5207113e5f4a.mp3","prompt":"","options":["get home","go to work","get up"],"answer":"go to work","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите действие.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/b143be6db88b.mp3","prompt":"","options":["go to bed","go out","get dressed"],"answer":"go to bed","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"go to work","pos":"","ru":"ехать на работу","kk":"жұмысқа бару","def":"I go to work by train.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/5207113e5f4a.mp3"},{"en":"start work","pos":"","ru":"начинать работу","kk":"жұмысты бастау","def":"I start work at eight.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/8cd40e964049.mp3"},{"en":"finish work","pos":"","ru":"заканчивать работу","kk":"жұмысты аяқтау","def":"I finish work at five.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/87ac333e9782.mp3"},{"en":"get home","pos":"","ru":"приходить домой","kk":"үйге келу","def":"I get home at 6.30.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/2e69b434a960.mp3"},{"en":"have dinner","pos":"","ru":"ужинать","kk":"кешкі ас ішу","def":"We have dinner at 7.30.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/80f03acf41e1.mp3"},{"en":"go to bed","pos":"","ru":"ложиться спать","kk":"ұйықтауға жату","def":"I go to bed at ten.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/b143be6db88b.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"match","title":"Соедините слово и перевод.","sub":"","pairs":[{"left":"get up","right":"вставать"},{"left":"have a shower","right":"принимать душ"},{"left":"check emails","right":"проверять почту"},{"left":"have dinner","right":"ужинать"},{"left":"go to bed","right":"ложиться спать"},{"left":"start work","right":"начинать работу"}],"options":["вставать","ложиться спать","принимать душ","начинать работу","ужинать","проверять почту"]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"phrases","title":"Послушайте два предложения.","sub":"Слушайте окончание глагола.","items":[{"text":"I get up at six.","src":null},{"text":"He gets up at nine.","src":null}]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Present Simple","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Лицо</th><th>Глагол</th><th>Пример</th></tr><tr><td>I</td><td>get up</td><td>I get up at six.</td></tr><tr><td>You</td><td>start</td><td>You start work at nine.</td></tr><tr><td>He</td><td>gets up</td><td>He gets up at nine.</td></tr><tr><td>She</td><td>finishes</td><td>She finishes at five.</td></tr><tr><td>We</td><td>have</td><td>We have dinner at 7.30.</td></tr><tr><td>They</td><td>go</td><td>They go to bed at ten.</td></tr></table><p>Только <b>he</b>, <b>she</b>, <b>it</b> получают <b>-s</b>: he get<b>s</b> up.</p><p>После s, sh, ch, x — <b>-es</b>: she finish<b>es</b>.</p><p><b>Have</b> особый: he <b>has</b> breakfast.</p><p class=\"cp-note__fwd\">Отрицания и вопросы будут в уроке 14.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Когда вы это делаете?","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th></th><th>Предложение</th><th>Слова времени</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>I start work at 9.</td><td>at + clock time</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>I work on Monday.</td><td>on + day</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>I check emails in the morning.</td><td>in + part of the day</td></tr></table><p>Слова времени из уроков 11 и 12 работают и здесь.</p><p>Время обычно в конце: I get up <b>at six</b>.</p><p>Можно и в начале: <b>In the morning</b> I check emails.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Смотрите и слушайте.","sub":"","html":"","examples":["I get up at five.","I check my emails.","My children get up at 6.30.","He starts work at 8 p.m.","She finishes at four.","We have dinner at 7.30."]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"I ___ up at six.","options":["gets","get","getting"],"keep":false,"answer":"get","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"He ___ up at nine.","options":["get","gets","getting"],"keep":false,"answer":"gets","why":"С he глагол получает -s.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"She ___ breakfast at eight.","options":["have","haves","has"],"keep":false,"answer":"has","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"She","after":"work at five.","answers":["finishes"],"bank":["finish","finishes","finishs"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"They","after":"to bed at ten.","answers":["go"],"bank":["gos","go","goes"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"My husband","after":"at home.","answers":["works"],"bank":["works","working","work"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"cols","title":"Какая форма глагола?","sub":"","columns":["work","works"],"items":[{"text":"my sister","col":1},{"text":"we","col":0},{"text":"she","col":1},{"text":"they","col":0},{"text":"he","col":1},{"text":"I","col":0}]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["up","at","o'clock.","six","I","get"],"answer":"I get up at six o'clock.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["at","starts","nine.","work","She"],"answer":"She starts work at nine.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["half","have","dinner","seven.","We","past","at"],"answer":"We have dinner at half past seven.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["He","get","up","at","nine."],"bad":1,"answer":"He gets up at nine.","why":"С he глагол получает -s."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["She","haves","breakfast","at","eight."],"bad":1,"answer":"She has breakfast at eight.","why":"Have превращается в has."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["They","goes","to","bed","at","ten."],"bad":1,"answer":"They go to bed at ten.","why":"С they — глагол без окончания."},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/68adf5e9348d.mp3","prompt":"Во сколько встаёт Хелена?","options":["at 5.00","at 6.30","at 7.30"],"answer":"at 5.00","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/68adf5e9348d.mp3","prompt":"Что она делает первым делом?","options":["has breakfast","checks her emails","goes to work"],"answer":"checks her emails","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/68adf5e9348d.mp3","before":"Her children get up at about","after":".","answers":["6.30"],"bank":["6.30","5.00","7.30"]},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/fc2da2d05f08.mp3","prompt":"Во сколько она встаёт?","options":["at 7 a.m.","at 8 a.m.","at 9 a.m."],"answer":"at 8 a.m.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/009430d1da34.mp3","prompt":"Кто работает дома?","options":["she does","her husband does","nobody does"],"answer":"her husband does","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/a4b9a89eaeb2.mp3","before":"He","after":"for a newspaper.","answers":["works"],"bank":["works","work","working"]},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/ec095ce483e8.mp3","prompt":"Во сколько он начинает работу?","options":["at 8 a.m.","at 4 a.m.","at 8 p.m."],"answer":"at 8 p.m.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/ec095ce483e8.mp3","prompt":"Во сколько он ложится спать?","options":["at 7 a.m.","at 5 a.m.","at 2 p.m."],"answer":"at 7 a.m.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"note","title":"Прочитайте про Миру.","sub":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Mira</p><p>Hi! I'm Mira. I get up at six o'clock.</p><p>I have breakfast and I check my emails.</p><p>I start work at eight and I finish at five.</p><p>My husband works at home. He gets up at nine!</p>"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Mira gets up at six.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Mira</p><p>Hi! I'm Mira. I get up at six o'clock.</p><p>I have breakfast and I check my emails.</p><p>I start work at eight and I finish at five.</p><p>My husband works at home. He gets up at nine!</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Her husband gets up at six too.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Mira</p><p>Hi! I'm Mira. I get up at six o'clock.</p><p>I have breakfast and I check my emails.</p><p>I start work at eight and I finish at five.</p><p>My husband works at home. He gets up at nine!</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Her husband","after":"at home.","answers":["works"],"bank":["work","works","is working"],"why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Mira</p><p>Hi! I'm Mira. I get up at six o'clock.</p><p>I have breakfast and I check my emails.</p><p>I start work at eight and I finish at five.</p><p>My husband works at home. He gets up at nine!</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Напишите о своём дне.","sub":"Три ваших действия — со временем.","placeholder":"","html":"<ul class=\"cp-frames\"><li>I get up at ___ .</li><li>I start work at ___ .</li><li>My ___ gets up at ___ .</li></ul><div class=\"cp-note__chips\"><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I get up</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I have breakfast</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I start work</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I go to bed</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">at six</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">at eight</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">at ten</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">my brother</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">gets up</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">works</span></div>","modelHtml":"<ul class=\"cp-checks\"><li>В предложениях с <b>I</b> нет <b>-s</b>.</li><li>В предложении о другом человеке есть <b>-s</b>.</li><li>Перед временем — <b>at</b>.</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"record","title":"Произнесите предложения. Запишите и послушайте.","sub":"Сначала послушайте каждое предложение.","items":["I get up at six o'clock.","I have breakfast at seven.","She starts work at nine.","We go to bed at ten."]},{"stage":"Wrap","type":"checklist","title":"Урок 13 пройден","sub":"Урок 13 из 24 · Юнит 4","items":["Я могу описать свой день.","Я могу добавлять -s для he и she.","Я могу сказать, когда что делаю."]}]}
